BLDC:
Input signal: The MCU sends a command to an ESC-->ESC Ssnd dutycycle PWM to motor
Command units: PWM duty cycle (%), pulse width (µs)
Driver required: Electronic Speed Controller (ESC) or three-phase inverter/motor controller,FOC 
Feedback available: HALL EFECT Sensor,for high rpm back emf,encoder
Holding behaviour:position dosen't hold 
Typical failure mode: Overheating, overcurrent, loss of proper commutation, ESC/MOSFET failure, or inability to produce the required torque under excessive load
Obvious application: High-efficiency/high-power drivetrains, drones, electric vehicles, high-speed actuators, and applications requiring high power density